

#----------------------------------------------------------------------|
# Subject: area: what changed - at most 72 characters (the | above is
# column 72), e.g. "live_gate: gate gh variable set". A blank line, then
# the body: why the change, what a reader of `git log` needs, wrapped at
# 72. Last, the trailers that apply, one per line:
#
# Plan: docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md
# Backlog: N
# Live: none | <what was written, when (UTC), Ryan's go>
#
# Lines starting with # are dropped. Installed by `make hooks`.
